<title>USA: TABLE - Mizar Inc Q4 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Mizar Inc Q4 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					 June 30,	    June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	   1996	1997	 1996</p>
